---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { href } from '../../lib/site'

const canonical = 'https://www.untded.org/dataset/untded-2005'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dataset: UNTDED 2005 — UN/TDED"
  description="This IRI identifies the United Nations Trade Data Elements Directory 2005 (ISO 7372:2005, ECE/TRADE/362) as digitized and published by this website, which is a member-contribution pilot project to UN/CEFACT and ISO/TC 154."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-un-deep">Dataset</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">UNTDED 2005</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 break-all font-mono text-xs text-body">{canonical}</p>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-body">
      This IRI identifies the digitized edition of the{' '}
      <strong class="font-medium text-ink">United Nations Trade Data Elements Directory, 2005
      edition</strong>, which was published in parallel as{' '}
      <strong class="font-medium text-ink">ISO 7372:2005</strong> and as UN document{' '}
      <span class="font-mono text-xs">ECE/TRADE/362</span>. It contains 1504 trade data
      elements with their names, definitions, representations, change tags against the
      1993 edition and locations on the aligned trade document systems. The content is
      © United Nations / UNECE and is reproduced here with attribution. This website
      and the dataset are a member-contribution pilot project to UN/CEFACT (UNECE) and
      ISO/TC 154, and they are not an official publication.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <a href={href('/download')} class="rounded-md border border-line bg-paper p-5 transition-colors hover:border-un/60">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Machine formats →</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
          The whole directory is published as JSON, CSV, JSON-LD and Turtle,
          together with the JSON-LD context, the ontology declaration and the
          UN/EDIFACT joins.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a href={href('/about')} class="rounded-md border border-line bg-paper p-5 transition-colors hover:border-un/60">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Operation and mandate →</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
          The page describes who maintains this registry, under which resolutions,
          and how corrections or a new edition are requested.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a href={href('/guides/provenance')} class="rounded-md border border-line bg-paper p-5 transition-colors hover:border-un/60">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Provenance →</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
          The note describes how the dataset was extracted from the publication and
          verified, and every element names its page in the source.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/untded/untded-2005" class="rounded-md border border-line bg-paper p-5 transition-colors hover:border-un/60">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Source repository ↗</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
          The repository <span class="font-mono text-xs">untded/untded-2005</span>{' '}
          contains the YAML single source of truth and the pipeline that generates
          every artifact above.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
